# MCP.md

Model Context Protocol servers bundled with the agentic-workflow plugin. **MCP config is
plugin-global** — it loads from the installed plugin, not from this project. Do not add
a project-local `.cursor/mcp.json` expecting the plugin servers to merge with it (add
project-specific servers in Cursor/Claude settings separately if needed).

After bootstrap, a read-only symlink is at `.cursor/agentic-workflow-mcp.json` for
browsing the plugin config.

| Location | Path |
|---|---|
| Cursor plugin (active) | `~/.cursor/plugins/local/agentic-workflow/mcp.json` |
| Claude Code plugin (active) | plugin `.mcp.json` (via `/plugin install`) |
| In-repo (reference) | `.cursor/agentic-workflow-mcp.json` — symlink only |

## Servers

| Server | Purpose | Env required |
|---|---|---|
| `github` | GitHub API (issues, PRs, repos) via `@modelcontextprotocol/server-github` | `GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN` |

Set the token in your shell or harness MCP settings before using GitHub MCP tools.

Override the symlink source with `AGENTIC_WORKFLOW_MCP=/path/to/mcp.json` if needed.
